config BR2_PACKAGE_FP2_FIRMWARE
        bool "Fairphone 2 Firmware [FP2]"
        help
          Proprietary firmware blobs for the Fairphone 2: modem (MPSS),
          ADSP, WCNSS Wi-Fi/BT, Venus, plus the ADSP sensor registry
          (qcom/sensors/sns.reg) for the in-kernel qcom_sns_reg driver.
